# Structural seams — committed on purpose.
#
# These are paths and tool prefixes belonging to a private tree that must never
# be referenced from a shippable plugin surface. They identify no person, org,
# or product, so tracking them here leaks nothing — which is why they are
# deliberately absent from the machine-local denylist that carries identifying
# tokens.
#
# One Python regex per line; `#` starts a comment; matching is
# case-insensitive. Use \b anchors for word-boundary tokens.
#
# This file is never itself scanned: `scripts/leak-gate` points only at the
# shippable plugin surfaces under tools/, and this lives outside them.

mcp__brain__
code/brain
